        <mxCell id="relationship_reading" value="&lt;b&gt;NRT Booking Case&lt;/b&gt; has exactly 1 Timing Result; each Timing Result belongs to exactly 1 NRT Booking Case.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Timing Result&lt;/b&gt; selects 0 or 1 Shipment Match Profile; one Profile supports 0 to many Timing Results." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#E4E7EC;fillColor=#FFFFFF;rounded=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;fontSize=11;fontColor=#101828;" parent="1" vertex="1">
